          For “How do they produce energy?”, solar panels and wind turbines
          come into view. The navigation is tucked behind a menu button so the
          globe gets as much space as possible.
      imagePosition: left
  - discriminant: imageText
    value:
      headline:
        de: Weitere Artikel
        en: Further articles
      image: /assets/online-design/solarpunk-world/blocks/9/value/image.jpg
      alt:
        de: >-
          Seite „Weitere Artikel“ mit Karten zu externen Artikeln über
